web888-boot (2026.07-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial package (docs/dev/github-ci-apt-repo-research.md §2.8).
    - Ships /usr/lib/web888-boot/: boot.bin (source-built FSBL +
      mainline U-Boot v2026.07 SSBL, packed by build-bootbin.sh uboot),
      the individual fsbl.bin / u-boot.bin components, boot.scr, and the
      default uEnv.txt.
    - postinst configure: on a booted device (FAT partition mounted at
      /boot) updates /boot/boot.bin and /boot/boot.scr via temp-file +
      sync + rename, keeping one-generation backups (boot.bin.bak,
      boot.scr.bak); refuses to write a payload without the Zynq boot
      header sync word. uEnv.txt is installed only when absent — user
      edits (kernel_file overrides) are never clobbered.
    - Skips silently when /boot/boot.bin is absent (chroot/image
      build), so the deb is safe to install during rootfs assembly.

